### 错误标注
1. an integral achievement：integral 侧重 “不可缺少的”，此处用 remarkable（重大的）更贴合语义
2. By developing of many years：搭配错误，改为 After years of development
3. the biggest nets：net 是可数名词，network 表示交通网络，用单数 network
4. high velocity and security：书面生硬，四级常用 high speed and safety/reliability
5. extremely shortens：extremely 修饰不当，改用 greatly（大大地）
6. trip time：标准表达是 travel time
7. which is convenient for people in visiting relatives：句式累赘，改用 making it convenient for sb to do
8. travling：拼写错误 → traveling
9. bussiness trip：拼写错误 → business trips（复数）
10. technologies：此处技术为整体概念，用单数 technology
11. has been exported：主语 technology 单数，语法正确，但 Chinese technologies 表达别扭，改为 China's high-speed rail technology
12. national name card：固定地道表达 national business card


